[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5400.629, "timestamp": "01:30:00", "text": "我覺得它不在這裡。  或許是因為昨天重置後我來到這裡尋找它。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5413.189, "timestamp": "01:30:13", "text": "它可能不在這裡。既然如此，那就從今天就開始吧。嗯，我們可以在這張地圖上找寶箱。一秒鐘。讓我來介紹一下我的成就。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5428.47, "timestamp": "01:30:28", "text": "現在是8點30分。我得吃晚餐了。我餓了。  飢餓的。  普里曼德。  普里曼德。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5432.582, "timestamp": "01:30:32", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "https://joqnix.space/stream-widgets/v..."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5438.229, "timestamp": "01:30:38", "text": "好的。  是的，我會少吃一點。現在不要。稍等片刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5441.11, "timestamp": "01:30:41", "text": "搞定了。  另外，呃，讓我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5448.55, "timestamp": "01:30:48", "text": "啟動一些東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5451.51, "timestamp": "01:30:51", "text": "這個人，禁用這個功能並保存。  是的，我馬上"}]